  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 09 October 2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 09 October 2025 and numbered Unnumbered Location Plan, Unnumbered Proposed Site Plan was lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because:\r\nThe private vehicle hire business within the property would not have public access, and there would be only one operator at the premises. No external alterations are proposed.  There would be no picking up or dropping off of customers at the site, nor would there be the comings and goings of drivers to the premises.  The nature and scale of the business use would not constitute a material change of use of part or the whole of the house, and therefore, planning permission is not required.\r\n"
